{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 个别段落的感受词和意象堆得过满，少数补充联想略显用力，人物动机的因果线也不如 X 连贯。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的短句分层、重点加亮和按乐句出现的感受提示，让普通观众更容易在短时间内抓住每段的情节节点，不必从长句中寻找重点。反复出现的水面、摇荡、小船等意象也增强了前后呼应，感受的细节和音乐变化结合得更紧。X 的优势是完整因果句更自然，人物为什么犹豫、退缩、重新放开说得更清楚，但整体而言，Y 更适合边听音乐边扫屏幕。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "21efb9c8-9a09-4b1e-815a-96cfc0ff55fe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T194511870722Z", "elapsed_seconds": 162.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:47:53.990833+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cc236a925bd725ba67dcc47a88b6d6cf46ad0f2f8ca56de991f82897fba450a6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2